                  },
                  {
                    "value": " of the marketplace's late orders — but disproportionately: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "RJ contributes 21.3% of late orders on just 12.8% of order volume",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ", while ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "SP's 30.5% late-order share sits well below its 42.0% volume share",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": ".",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "RJ's problem isn't speed — its carrier-transit inconsistency ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "16pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "(10.7-day std. dev.)",
